<title>FRANCE: MOTOR RACING-LE MANS 24-HOUR FINAL QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LE MANS 24-HOUR FINAL QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>LE MANS, France 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final qualifying times</p>
<p>for this weekend's Le Mans 24-hour race:</p>
<p> 1. Michele Alboreto (Italy) Joest Porsche Prototype  3 minutes</p>
<p>41.581 seconds (average speed 220.958 kph)</p>
<p> 2. Thierry Boutsen (Belgium) Porsche 911		3:43.363</p>
<p> 3. Eric van de Poele (Belgium) Nissan R390	    3:45.324</p>
<p> 4. J.J. Lehto (Finland) BMW McLaren F1		  3:45.402</p>
<p> 5. Emmanuel Collard (France) Porsche 911		3:45.490</p>
<p> 6. Pierluigi Martini (Italy) BMS Porsche 911	  3:45.913</p>
<p> 7. Martin Brundle (Britain) Nissan R390		 3:46.228</p>
<p> 8. Christophe Bouchut (France) Kremer Porsche 911   3:46.389</p>
<p> 9. Max Papis (Italy) Ferrari 330SP Prototype	  3:46.431</p>
<p> 10. Gary Ayles (Britain) Lark McLaren F1		3:47.108</p>
